 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources.
-*   **Strengths:** Effectively suppresses floaters in front of occupied voxels in sparse voxel maps [S1, unofficial]. Reduces mesh distortion (e.g., intersecting triangles) and face flipping during joint optimization [S2]. Acts as a geometric prior that constrains optimization, improving surface quality [S2].
-*   **Limitations:** Does not constrain the field along unmeasured rays in the radiance field variant; it only smooths between proxies [S1, unofficial]. Requires accurate depth estimation or mesh topology [S1, unofficial][S2].
